        "description": {
          "value": "<p>An avatar is a summoned outsider whose Hit Dice, saving throws, skills, feats, and abilities advance with its summoner's class level. An avatar's caster level equals its Hit Dice.</p><p><strong>Avatar Skills</strong>: Bluff, Craft, Knowledge (planes), Perception, Sense Motive, and Stealth; the summoner selects four more at 1st level.</p>"
